{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tripify-info-service-collection",
    "name": "Tripify Info Service",
    "description": "info-service (Docker: :8087, bootRun: :8080)\n\n**Обязательные заголовки на всех ручках:**\n- `X-Anonymous-Id`\n- `X-Request-Id`\n\n**JWT:** опционально (`Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}`)\n\n**Страны (ISO alpha-2):** RU, CN, AE, TR, TH, ES, IT, FR, JP, EG\n\n**GET /countries/{id}/info:** обязательны `date_from`, `date_to`. Курсы в `rates[]` (base = `local_currency`), tab `weather` — при запросе.\n\n**Flow:** refresh → get country info.\n\nФормула: `сумма_в_local = сумма_в_X × rate`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8087",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "countryId",
      "value": "CN",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "localCurrency",
      "value": "CNY",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "baseCurrency",
      "value": "CNY",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "xAnonymousId",
      "value": "anon_postman_test_001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "xRequestId",
      "value": "req-postman-001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwtToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "stayDateFrom",
      "value": "2026-06-15",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "stayDateTo",
      "value": "2026-06-22",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{jwtToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Flow — China (CN → CNY)",
      "description": "Полный сценарий: refresh → info (включая currency.rates)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Refresh China",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('xRequestId', 'req-' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Anonymous-Id", "value": "{{xAnonymousId}}" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "{{xRequestId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/admin/countries/CN/refresh",
            "description": "Парсит Tutu и сохраняет в Mongo. 10–30 сек."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Get China info",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('xRequestId', 'req-' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.test('Has local_currency', () => pm.expect(body.local_currency).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "  const weatherTab = (body.tabs || []).find(t => t.code === 'weather');",
                  "  pm.test('Has weather tab', () => pm.expect(weatherTab).to.be.an('object');",
                  "  pm.test('Has weather days', () => pm.expect(weatherTab.sections[0].data).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty);",
                  "  pm.test('Has rates', () => pm.expect(body.rates).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty);",
                  "  if (body.local_currency) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('localCurrency', body.local_currency);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('baseCurrency', body.local_currency);",
                  "    console.log('local_currency saved:', body.local_currency);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Anonymous-Id", "value": "{{xAnonymousId}}" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "{{xRequestId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/countries/CN/info?date_from={{stayDateFrom}}&date_to={{stayDateTo}}",
            "description": "Проверяет `local_currency`, `rates`, tab `weather`. Даты: {{stayDateFrom}} — {{stayDateTo}}."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "info (product)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get country info",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('xRequestId', 'req-' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.local_currency) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('localCurrency', body.local_currency);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('baseCurrency', body.local_currency);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Anonymous-Id", "value": "{{xAnonymousId}}" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "{{xRequestId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/countries/{{countryId}}/info?date_from={{stayDateFrom}}&date_to={{stayDateTo}}",
            "description": "Ответ: `country_id`, `country_name`, `local_currency`, **`rates`**, `tabs`.\n\n`rates` — курсы в local_currency. Tab `weather` — при успешной погоде.\n\nСтраны: RU, CN, AE, TR, TH, ES, IT, FR, JP, EG."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get country info (CN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Anonymous-Id", "value": "{{xAnonymousId}}" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "{{xRequestId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/countries/CN/info?date_from={{stayDateFrom}}&date_to={{stayDateTo}}"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get country info (AE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Anonymous-Id", "value": "{{xAnonymousId}}" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "{{xRequestId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/countries/AE/info?date_from={{stayDateFrom}}&date_to={{stayDateTo}}"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get country info — unsupported (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Anonymous-Id", "value": "{{xAnonymousId}}" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "{{xRequestId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/countries/AM/info?date_from={{stayDateFrom}}&date_to={{stayDateTo}}"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get country info — not in Mongo (expect 404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Anonymous-Id", "value": "{{xAnonymousId}}" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "{{xRequestId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/countries/EG/info?date_from={{stayDateFrom}}&date_to={{stayDateTo}}",
            "description": "404 если не делали refresh для этой страны."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "info-admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Refresh country info",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('xRequestId', 'req-' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Anonymous-Id", "value": "{{xAnonymousId}}" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "{{xRequestId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/admin/countries/{{countryId}}/refresh"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh China (CN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Anonymous-Id", "value": "{{xAnonymousId}}" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "{{xRequestId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/admin/countries/CN/refresh"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh UAE (AE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Anonymous-Id", "value": "{{xAnonymousId}}" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "{{xRequestId}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/admin/countries/AE/refresh"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
